\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\">\n<div class=\"saudia-destination-wrapper\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n<p>Ascend to Abha, where cool mountain breezes and vibrant violet jacarandas redefine your Arabian escape. Nestled high in the Sarawat Mountains, this \"\"\"\"Bride of the Mountain\"\"\"\" invites you to wander through historic mud-walled palaces, explore the artistic soul of Al-Muftaha Village, and soar over lush national parks by cable car. Experience a refreshing blend of heritage and nature in Saudi Arabia’s southwestern jewel. Welcome to our Future.</p>\n<h3>Riyadh :Daily</h3>\n<h3>Jeddah :Daily</h3>\n<div class=\"saudia-banner\">\n<div class=\"saudia-banner-overlay\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"saudia-banner-content\">\n<h3 class=\"saudia-banner-title\">Discover Abha: Breathe in the Beauty of the City in the Clouds</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"saudia-itinerary-box\">\n<h4>1. Explore Rijal Almaa Heritage Village</h4>\n<p> Journey back 900 years in the \"\"\"\"Gingerbread Village\"\"\"\" of the Asir Mountains. Marvel at the stunning architecture of 60 multi-story palaces built from natural stone, clay, and wood. Admire the colorful wooden windows and the intricate Al-Qatt Al-Asiri geometric art, a UNESCO-recognized tradition hand-painted by local women. Visit the heritage museum in Al Elwan Palace to discover a treasure trove of over 2,000 ancient artifacts and manuscripts.</p>\n<h4>2. Ride The Abha Cable Car</h4>\n<p> Soar above the mist and witness breathtaking panoramic views from one of the city's four iconic cable car routes. Glide 400 meters over the sparkling Abha Dam Lake toward the summit of Green Mountain, or navigate deep gorges and dense juniper forests on the way to Jabal Sawda, the highest peak in the Kingdom. These elevated journeys transform simple transportation into an unforgettable sightseeing adventure.</p>\n<h4>3. Stroll Along Art Street</h4>\n<p> Walk beneath a canopy of purple jacaranda blooms in the heart of Abha’s scenic valley. This vibrant destination celebrates the region's creative spirit with open-air galleries, colorful murals, and artistic installations. It is the perfect place to enjoy a leisurely afternoon, capturing beautiful photographs and soaking in the local culture before heading to a nearby chic cafe.</p>\n<h4>4. Visit Asir National Park</h4>\n<p> Breathe in the crisp air of Saudi Arabia’s first national park, a vast sanctuary of wilderness and towering peaks. Explore the mist-covered heights of Al Soudah, where ancient juniper trees and wild baboons thrive at 3,000 meters above sea level. Whether you are hiking rugged trails or enjoying a family picnic at El Sahab Park, the dramatic landscapes offer a refreshing escape into nature.</p>\n<h4>5. Shop At Tuesday Traditional Market</h4>\n<p> Immerse yourself in the bustling energy of one of the region's oldest commercial hubs. Browse over a hundred stalls filled with the aroma of high-quality mountain honey, fragrant herbs, and seasonal fruits like pomegranates and figs. Discover authentic souvenirs, from handcrafted silver jewelry and traditional Asiri attire to intricate pottery made by local artisans.</p>\n</div>\n</div></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-faq class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"faq-section ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.lt-lg=\"column\" fxlayoutgap=\"20px grid\" fxlayoutgap.gt-lg=\"24px grid\"><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\" class=\"faq__title\"><h2 class=\"primary-heading ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"\">FAQs</h2><!----><!----></div><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\"><mat-accordion class=\"mat-accordion faq__accordion\"><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-6 mat-expanded mat-expansion-panel-spacing ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-7 ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-animate-disabled mat-expanded mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How far in advance should I book my flight to Abha?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-7\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-7\"> How far in advance should I book my flight to Abha? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-7 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-0\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-0\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-6\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>The best time to book a flight to Abha&nbsp;is 3 - 6 months before your date of travel. This would give you the best chance of finding the best prices and timings that fit your schedule.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-8 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-9 ng-tns-c1859850774-8 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Can I change or cancel my flight to Abha?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-1\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-9\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-9\"> Can I change or cancel my flight to Abha? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-9 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-8 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-1\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-1\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-8\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>Yes, we offer free cancellation on flight to Abha&nbsp;subject to our cancellation and refund policy. Read our <a href=\"/en-SA/book-and-manage/manage/refund\">cancellation and refund policy for more information</a>.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-10 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-11 ng-tns-c1859850774-10 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Can I get extra baggage allowance for flights to Abha?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-2\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-11\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-11\"> Can I get extra baggage allowance for flights to Abha? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-11 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-10 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-2\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-2\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-10\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>If our standard baggage allowance is not enough, you can add extra baggage to your flight booking at an additional fee.&nbsp;Read more about our <a href=\"/sitecore/service/notfound.aspx?item=web%3a%7b31152426-158B-48D0-8AE9-BADDD086F264%7d%40en-SA\">addition baggage charges</a>.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><!----></mat-accordion></div></div></div></div><!----></app-jss-faq><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-theme class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div data-theme-change=\"White\" data-footer-theme-override=\"false\" class=\"themeTransition\"></div></app-jss-theme><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-html-snippet><div><div></div><!----></div></app-jss-html-snippet><!----></sc-placeholder>"}